\f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid9190566\charrsid16654566 respect him for his charisma, knowledge, expertise and his vision. }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid15215434\charrsid16654566 
