\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid15954368\charrsid16654566 Charismatic leaders can hurt an organization because their followers might go against the legitimate chain of command of the organization to follow the leader. }{\rtlch\fcs1 
\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid10424642\charrsid16654566 As it is not necessary for 
the charismatic leader to have legitimate authority therefore he might not follow the proper chain of command. This creates the problem of unity of command. People will follow two managers. One will be their manager according to the company hierarchy or s
tructure and one will be the leader. This might create people-role conflict for employees. }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid10095080  This affects the organization in a negative way}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid12152680  and hurt the organization.
