\b\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid9336291\charrsid9336291  }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid9336291\charrsid9336291 \'93As important as attracting good employees is, it is just as important to retain them\'94. How you can justify this statement. }{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid9336291 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid10317086 
\par 
\par }\pard \ltrpar\qj \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid6124406 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\ul\cf0\highlight7\ulc0\insrsid10317086\charrsid10317086 Answer :}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid10317086  }{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid10317086\charrsid16654566 Employees are the biggest assets for an organization. They are the real }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid9783833\charrsid16654566 
distinctive competency of an organization. The organizations who pay heed to this fact are the most successful ones. }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid14627004\charrsid16654566 
 Technology and other resources that a successful organization holds can be acquired by other organizations as well but motivated, expert }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid353951 and skilled }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid14627004\charrsid16654566 employees that one firm has }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid14356864\charrsid16654566 cannot}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid14627004\charrsid16654566 
 be duplicated easily by other firms. That is the main reason competing firms try to buy out employees from their rivals in an attempt to }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid6124406\charrsid16654566 
gain the distinctive competencies that the rival holds because of these employees. }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid14627004\charrsid16654566 
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid14627004\charrsid16654566 
\par }\pard \ltrpar\qj \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid3935476 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid14627004\charrsid16654566 Th}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid3935476\charrsid16654566 
erefore for an organization to be successful, it should not only attract or hire good employees but it should also retain them. There are a number of reasons why retaining is also as important or even more important than hiring good employee
s. Some of the reasons are: 
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid3935476\charrsid16654566 
