t like to work for this company and the employees who are sticking around might be making a mistake. This often urges other employees also to either look for better opportunities and they loose loyalty and commitment to }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid12923928 the company.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid5719658 
