this experience can\rquote t be replaced. The company might hire some one with the same qualification but the }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid16015384 experience that the leaving employee has will not be there.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 
