\b\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid9336291\charrsid9336291  }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid9336291\charrsid9336291 What is flextime? What are the advantages of flextime from an employee\rquote s perspective and from management\rquote s perspective?
}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af3 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid9336291\charrsid9336291 
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid12608857 
\par }\pard \ltrpar\qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid12608857 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\ul\cf0\highlight7\ulc0\insrsid12608857\charrsid12608857 Answer :}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid12608857  }{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid12608857\charrsid9062798 Flextime is a work arrangement where an employee works for the same core hours during the 
day but the arrangement of these hours or how he makes up these hours from the day is flexible. For example a company might have a policy for employees to work for eight hours every day and the company starts at 8.00 AM. So in flextime arrangement the emp
loyee might be given the discretion of working for eight hours but not necessarily from 8 AM. An employee might start for example at 10 AM and work up to 6 AM thereby completing eight hours of work and starting at his convenient time. }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 
\ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid11676037\charrsid9062798 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid12608857\charrsid9062798 This is only one example of flextime. Other methods include fl}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid5133672\charrsid9062798 exible or compressed work weeks}{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid13122750  where the employee can work for more hours during some days and thereby reducing the total working days during the week. Others include }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid5133672\charrsid9062798 job sharing }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid11676037\charrsid9062798 , part time work arrangements}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid9066363  and }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 
\ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2843232\charrsid9062798 telecommuting}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid5133672\charrsid9062798 . }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid12608857\charrsid9062798 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid5133672\charrsid9062798 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\ul\cf2\highlight7\ulc0\insrsid11813404\charrsid9062798 Advantages from employee\rquote s perspective}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid11813404\charrsid9062798 : }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
