\par }\pard \ltrpar\qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14120759 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid14120759\charrsid9062798 Int
erview is a method of verbal communication and therefore is subjective. It depends a lot on the }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid16271279\charrsid9062798 context }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid14120759\charrsid9062798 under which the interview was conducted}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid16271279\charrsid9062798  and also on the interviewer\rquote 
s skills as well his perceptions. As human interaction gets involved}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid14120759\charrsid9062798  }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid12792630 here, }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid16271279\charrsid9062798 therefore the interview can become very subjective instead of being objective.  A lot of issues related to human nature can be introduced during the interview which might make it biased. The biasness }{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid10122616\charrsid9062798 depends on many factors. These factors can lead to interviewing mistakes which adversely affects the effectiveness of the job interview.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\ul\cf2\ulc0\insrsid14120759\charrsid9062798 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid10122616\charrsid9062798 Some of the mistakes that can lessen the effectiveness of the job interview are : 
\par 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\cf2\insrsid16654544\charrsid9062798 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 1)\tab}}\pard \ltrpar\qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\ls8\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid10122616 {\rtlch\fcs1 
\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\ul\cf2\ulc0\insrsid16654544\charrsid9062798 Selective perception:}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid16654544\charrsid9062798  }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid10122616\charrsid9062798 
The selective perception of the interviewer might affect the interview. Different people perceive the same situation at the same time in different ways. This is due to their life experiences, education, values and personality. So based on these they might
 interpret the same situation in different ways. This might create biasness in their judgment. 
\par }\pard \ltrpar\qj \li720\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid9502897 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid9502897\charrsid9062798 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\cf2\insrsid10122616\charrsid9062798 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 2)\tab}}\pard \ltrpar\qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\ls8\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid10122616 {\rtlch\fcs1 
\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\ul\cf2\ulc0\insrsid10122616\charrsid9062798 Projection: }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid10122616\charrsid9062798  Some interviewers }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid14567570\charrsid9062798 
might have some qualities and they might value th}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2823251 em }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid14567570\charrsid9062798 a lot and might want to see the same qualities in the in
terviewee and if they don\rquote }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid13332642 t see the same qualities, }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid14567570\charrsid9062798 they will be biased }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2522891\charrsid9062798 in their interview}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid16654544\charrsid9062798 . }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\ul\cf2\ulc0\insrsid10122616\charrsid9062798 
