\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\cf2\insrsid10245989\charrsid9062798 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 3)\tab}}\pard \ltrpar\qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\ls8\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid10122616 {\rtlch\fcs1 
\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\ul\cf2\ulc0\insrsid10245989\charrsid9062798 Stere}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\ul\cf2\ulc0\insrsid3421673\charrsid9062798 o}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\ul\cf2\ulc0\insrsid10245989\charrsid9062798 typing :}{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid10245989\charrsid9062798  Stereotyping is the preset judg}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid1530232\charrsid9062798 e}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid10245989\charrsid9062798 m}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid9502897\charrsid9062798 
ent a person makes based on the group to which the interviewee belongs. For example the interviewer might have a stereotype that women are not good for managerial positions so he might get biased into not giving good review }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid6847808 in  job interview }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid9502897\charrsid9062798 to a woman who applied for the a management position.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\ul\cf2\ulc0\insrsid16654544\charrsid9062798 

\par }\pard \ltrpar\qj \li720\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid9502897 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\ul\cf2\ulc0\insrsid9502897\charrsid9062798 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\cf2\insrsid9502897\charrsid9062798 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 4)\tab}}\pard \ltrpar\qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\ls8\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid10122616 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 
\ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\ul\cf2\ulc0\insrsid9502897\charrsid9062798 Halo effect: }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid9502897\charrsid9062798 
 Halo effect is when a person makes good or bad judgement based on just one quality. In this the interviewer might get biased based on just one quality and might give good reviews without paying atte
ntion to other good qualities or bad qualities that a person has. }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid5396710 Similarly the same thing goes for a bad quality that the interviewer might see in the interviewee.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\b\f1\ul\cf2\ulc0\insrsid9502897\charrsid9062798 
\par }\pard\plain \ltrpar\s21\ql \li720\ri0\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid9502897 \rtlch\fcs1 \af3\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs24\cf1\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033\ulc1 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\b\f1\ul\cf2\ulc0\insrsid9502897\charrsid9062798 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\cf2\insrsid9502897\charrsid9062798 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 5)\tab}}\pard\plain \ltrpar\qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\ls8\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid10122616 \rtlch\fcs1 
\af3\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs24\cf1\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033\ulc1 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\ul\cf2\ulc0\insrsid9502897\charrsid9062798 Similar to me effect }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid9502897\charrsid9062798 :: In this the interviewer might }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2692586\charrsid9062798 try to find qualities in an interviewee which is similar to the interviewer. If he doesn\rquote 
t find any such quality he will be biased to not hire the job applicant. If on the other hand he sees such a quality then he will be biased to hire the job applicant without paying attention to other qualities needed for the job}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 
\ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2692586\charrsid9062798 
\par }\pard\plain \ltrpar\s21\ql \li720\ri0\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid2692586 \rtlch\fcs1 \af3\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs24\cf1\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033\ulc1 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2692586\charrsid9062798 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\cf2\insrsid2692586\charrsid9062798 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 6)\tab}}\pard\plain \ltrpar\qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\ls8\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid2698386 \rtlch\fcs1 
\af3\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs24\cf1\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033\ulc1 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\ul\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2692586\charrsid9062798 Inadequate knowledge about the job: }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2692586\charrsid9062798  Some times the interviewer might not be well-versed with the exact requirements }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2698386\charrsid9062798 
for a position for which he might be conducting the interview. For example an HR manager hiring for a technical job in }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid8661707 the information technology department}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2698386\charrsid9062798 . As this is }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid8661707 a }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2698386\charrsid9062798 
completely technical field so the manager taking the interview might not be capable enough to do the interview because of his limited knowledge of the field of computer sciences. In this case
 he will be biased to see human or communications skills more than the technical skills the job applicant has that are more important to the job than his human skills. Similarly the interviewer might be hiring for a non technical position but he might lac
k the knowledge of the exact requirements or specifications for the job opening.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\ul\cf2\ulc0\insrsid9502897\charrsid9062798 
\par }\pard\plain \ltrpar\s21\ql \li720\ri0\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid2698386 \rtlch\fcs1 \af3\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs24\cf1\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033\ulc1 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\b\f1\ul\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2698386\charrsid9062798 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\cf2\insrsid12390187\charrsid9062798 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 7)\tab}}\pard\plain \ltrpar\qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\ls8\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid2698386 \rtlch\fcs1 
\af3\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs24\cf1\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033\ulc1 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\ul\cf2\ulc0\insrsid12390187\charrsid9062798 Previous interviewee effect: }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid12390187\charrsid9062798  If an interviewee is being interviewed immediately after a perceived good or bad interviewee then he will be judged against the previous inter
viewee. If the previous interviewee was perceived as very good by the interviewer then the next person will have difficulties in making a good impression on the interviewer and if the previous interviewee was perceived as bad then the next one will be con
sidered good even if he is just slightly better than the previous. So this creates a bias on the part of the interviewer and is one of the mistakes in job interviews which lessens its effectiveness. }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\b\f1\ul\cf2\ulc0\insrsid12390187\charrsid9062798 
\par }\pard\plain \ltrpar\s21\ql \li720\ri0\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid12390187 \rtlch\fcs1 \af3\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs24\cf1\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033\ulc1 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid12390187\charrsid9062798 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\cf2\insrsid12390187\charrsid9062798 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 8)\tab}}\pard\plain \ltrpar\qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\ls8\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid2698386 \rtlch\fcs1 
\af3\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs24\cf1\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033\ulc1 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\ul\cf2\ulc0\insrsid12390187\charrsid9062798 Preconceived notion about the interviewee : }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 
\ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid12390187\charrsid9062798 
 If the interviewer has already heard about the job interviewee before the interview from some other sources whether it is something good or bad about him, the interviewer will already have made an impression about the interviewee even before the intervie
w begins. So this can introduce a good or a bad bias on the part of the interviewer and lessens the effectiveness of the interview. }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\ul\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2698386\charrsid9062798 
\par }\pard\plain \ltrpar\s21\ql \li720\ri0\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid12390187 \rtlch\fcs1 \af3\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs24\cf1\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033\ulc1 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\b\f1\ul\cf2\ulc0\insrsid12390187\charrsid9062798 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\cf2\insrsid796382\charrsid9062798 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 9)\tab}}\pard\plain \ltrpar\qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\ls8\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid2698386 \rtlch\fcs1 
\af3\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs24\cf1\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033\ulc1 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\ul\cf2\ulc0\insrsid796382\charrsid9062798 Emotional state of the interviewer : }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid796382\charrsid9062798  As interview is a human interaction so it is prone to human emotions. If the inter
viewer is not emotionally stable then it might bias the interview. For example an interviewer sitting down to take the interview has just heard some bad news before the start of the interview sessions and that might affect his judgement in reviewing the r
ight person for the job. }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\ul\cf2\ulc0\insrsid12390187\charrsid9062798 
\par }\pard \ltrpar\qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid796382 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\ul\cf2\ulc0\insrsid796382\charrsid9062798 
\par }\pard \ltrpar\qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid12531665 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid796382\charrsid9062798 
All the factors mentioned above are mistakes that are involved in the interview process and that might affect the effectiveness of the job interview. T
here are many techniques to cope with these problems and make the interview as objective as possible so that exactly the right person can be hired for the right job.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid12531665  }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af3 
\ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid674934\charrsid9062798 
